{"height": 21, "weight": 4600, "base_experience": 189, "ev_yield": [{"stat": "hp", "value": 2}], "genus": "Sleeping Pokémon", "capture_rate": 25, "base_happiness": 70, "hatch_counter": 40, "growth_rate": "slow", "egg_groups": ["monster"], "gender_rate": 1, "names": [{"language": "ja-hrkt", "name": "カビゴン"}, {"language": "ja-roma", "name": "Kabigon"}, {"language": "ko", "name": "잠만보"}, {"language": "zh-hant", "name": "卡比獸"}, {"language": "fr", "name": "Ronflex"}, {"language": "de", "name": "Relaxo"}, {"language": "es", "name": "Snorlax"}, {"language": "it", "name": "Snorlax"}, {"language": "ja", "name": "カビゴン"}, {"language": "zh-hans", "name": "卡比兽"}, {"language": "es-419", "name": "Snorlax"}], "pokedex_entries": [{"versions": ["red", "blue", "leafgreen"], "text": "Very lazy. Just eats and sleeps. As its rotund bulk builds, it becomes steadily more slothful."}, {"versions": ["yellow", "lets-go-pikachu", "lets-go-eevee"], "text": "Will eat anything, even if the food happens to be a little moldy. It never gets an upset stomach."}, {"versions": ["gold"], "text": "What sounds like its cry may ac­ tually be its snores or the rumblings of its hungry belly."}, {"versions": ["silver"], "text": "Its stomach's di­ gestive juices can dissolve any kind of poison. It can even eat things off the ground."}, {"versions": ["crystal"], "text": "This POKéMON's stomach is so strong, even eating moldy or rotten food will not affect it."}, {"versions": ["ruby", "sapphire"], "text": "SNORLAX’s typical day consists of nothing more than eating and sleeping. It is such a docile POKéMON that there are children who use its expansive belly as a place to play."}, {"versions": ["emerald"], "text": "SNORLAX’s typical day consists of nothing more than eating and sleeping. It is such a docile POKéMON that there are children who use its big belly as a place to play."}, {"versions": ["firered", "x", "sword"], "text": "It is not satisfied unless it eats over 880 pounds of food every day. When it is done eating, it goes promptly to sleep."}, {"versions": ["diamond", "y"], "text": "Its stomach can digest any kind of food, even if it happens to be moldy or rotten."}, {"versions": ["pearl"], "text": "It stops eating only to sleep. It doesn’t feel full unless it eats nearly 900 pounds a day."}, {"versions": ["platinum", "black", "white", "black-2", "white-2"], "text": "When its belly is full, it becomes too lethargic to even lift a finger, so it is safe to bounce on its belly."}, {"versions": ["heartgold"], "text": "What sounds like its cry may actually be its snores or the rumblings of its hungry belly."}, {"versions": ["soulsilver"], "text": "Its stomach’s digestive juices can dissolve any kind of poison. It can even eat things off the ground."}, {"versions": ["omega-ruby", "alpha-sapphire"], "text": "Snorlax’s typical day consists of nothing more than eating and sleeping. It is such a docile Pokémon that there are children who use its expansive belly as a place to play."}, {"versions": ["sun"], "text": "Its stomach is said to be incomparably strong. Even Muk’s poison is nothing more than a hint of spice on Snorlax’s tongue."}, {"versions": ["moon"], "text": "It eats nearly 900 pounds of food every day. It starts nodding off while eating—and continues to eat even while it’s asleep."}, {"versions": ["ultra-sun"], "text": "It doesn’t do anything other than eat and sleep. When prompted to make a serious effort, though, it apparently displays awesome power."}, {"versions": ["ultra-moon"], "text": "It has no interest in anything other than eating. Even if you climb up on its stomach while it’s napping, it doesn’t seem to mind at all!"}, {"versions": ["shield"], "text": "This Pokémon’s stomach is so strong, even eating moldy or rotten food will not affect it."}, {"versions": ["legends-arceus"], "text": "This glutton appears in villages without warning and devours the entirety of their rice granaries—such occurrences have long been counted among the gravest of disasters."}],